flowchart TD
  V[Website visitor] --> P[Service, class, job or contact page]
  P --> CTA[Call to action]
  CTA --> FORM[Contact, consultation or newsletter form]
  FORM --> FV[Browser and server validation]
  FV -->|invalid| ERR[Inline error or generic failure]
  FV -->|valid| FN[Cloudflare Pages Function]
  FN --> SAFE[Normalize and validate payload]
  SAFE --> BREVO[Brevo contacts or transactional email]
  BREVO --> NOTIFY[MedLink VA notification]
  BREVO --> CONF[Success response or confirmation]
  NOTIFY --> FU[Contact follow-up]
  CONF --> UI[Success confirmation in browser]
  FN -->|provider or network failure| FAIL[Generic error response]